# Prime: setup

- `slopvac setup <harness>` installs a steering block, the `slopvac-prose` skill and, with `--agent`, a reviewer agent file.
- Harnesses: {{ harnesses | join(", ") }}.
- `slopvac setup --list` prints the files of each harness.
- `slopvac setup <harness> --check` changes nothing. Exit {{ exit_ok }} is current, {{ exit_findings }} is missing or stale, {{ exit_incomplete }} is malformed. Repair a malformed file by hand.
- `slopvac setup <harness> --remove` removes only what setup wrote.
- `--root <dir>` targets another project directory.
{% if level != "minimal" %}
- `--block minimal|standard` sets the size of the steering block. `--no-skill` skips the skill.
- `--reviewer-model <model>` writes the model into the reviewer agent. It must differ from the author's model.
- The reviewer agent runs only when `slopvac prime review` calls it.
{% endif %}
